yeah.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.080
Yeah, my

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.520
Yeah, my style in general in leadership

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.440
is to

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:21.200
hi- fire quickly. I I don't put put up

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.520
with low performers. Um I think the

