00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:10.400
I wouldn't say get out of their way. I I

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:13.000
still ask the right questions and make

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.360
sure each function of my business is

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.520
working on the lowest hanging fruit.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.360
That's kind of my

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.280
my uh management style. Look at the

